<title>USA: Fonar says GE agrees to pay judgement.</title>
<headline>Fonar says GE agrees to pay judgement.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonar Corp said Monday General Electric Co agreed to pay a $103 million judgement plus interest against it in a patent infringement suit.</p>
<p>In 1995 a federal jury awarded Fonar, which started proceedings against General Electric in 1992, $103 million. The Supreme Court refused on May 28 General Electric's request for a stay of paying the judgement while the company petitioned the high court to hear its case.</p>
</text>
